Third-party components and data in this repository

0. Repository ancestry: Karylcode/VRoid-MCP
   https://github.com/Karylcode/VRoid-MCP
   Local fork baseline: 9b264d3ad3a33bea2e18e91a0476e395246a6be6.
   Upstream license/author permission has not been confirmed by the maintainer.
   This is now maintained separately as froz3ncore/VRoid-Character-MCP.
   Full Git ancestry is preserved; the old fork is not deleted or rewritten.
   The root LICENSE grants MIT only for original contributions controlled by
   froz3ncore, not inherited portions. See LICENSING.md and UPSTREAM.json.
   The MIT notices listed below apply only to their respective sources.

1. vroid_mcp/data/preset_labels/
   Preset labels and the thumbnail-addressing algorithm are adapted from
   brainrom/vroid-studio-mcp, Copyright (c) 2026 Ilya Chelyadin and
   vroid-studio-mcp contributors, MIT, commit
   a6b0719d01fa6cac9a857956907243d9916390b2.
   See vroid_mcp/data/preset_labels/LICENSE and NOTICE.

2. vroid_mcp/data/parameter_labels/, data/color_state/, data/capture_quality/,
   data/capture_framing/
   Same upstream project and license; each directory carries its own LICENSE
   and NOTICE with the exact files and commit it came from.

3. frida-il2cpp-bridge (npm, MIT) is consumed at runtime through
   node_modules; it is not vendored in this repository.

4. frida (PyPI) and mcp (PyPI) are declared dependencies; their licenses are
   their own.

VRoid Studio, its assemblies and the VRM format are not distributed here.
Character assets, textures and Blender files produced during development stay
local and are excluded by .gitignore.
